 identity  sum_(n < 2^K, exactly m trailing ones) 2^(popcount(n) - m) = 3^(K-1-m)  for K <= 16, 1 <= m <= K-1: OK (proof: bits 0..m-1 are 1, bit m is 0, the K-1-m bits above are free and contribute (1+2)^(K-1-m))

